---
title: "Cambridge's Tessera named joint best software at OpenUK Awards"
date: 2026-11-12
tags: [announcement, news]
author: "Constantino Panagopulos"
description: "The open-source AI model is already helping researchers map smallholder crops in Senegal, tree species in Italy and hedgehog habitats across the UK. It has now shared the top software prize at the OpenUK Awards."
---

